Parameters:
- $v_j$: Value of product $j$ (from "Value" in products.csv)
- $w_j$: Space requirement of product $j$ (from "Weight" in products.csv)
- $C_i$: Capacity of section $i$ (from "Capacity" in capacity.csv)

